			"Message": "build(Cocoon): Migrate documentation domains to editor.land and regenerate RouteManifest with tiered routing\n\nUpdate all documentation references from PlayForm.Cloud/Land.PlayForm.Cloud to editor.land across README.md and Documentation/GitHub/DeepDive.md, aligning with the active project domain.\n\nIntroduce generated Source/Generated/RouteManifest.ts defining the four-tier RPC routing hierarchy: MountainMethods (145 Rust handlers from Mountain), StockLiftExports (tier 2, currently empty), BespokeCocoonMethods (1 Node fallback: FindTextInFilesNodeFallback), with tier 4 implicit unavailable methods throwing via DualTrack. Add accompanying RouteManifest.Report.md for generation metadata.\n\nRefresh dependencies: effect 3.21.2→3.21.3, protobufjs 8.6.0→8.6.1, @types/node 25.9.1→25.9.2. Clean up build configuration formatting in Source/ESBuild.js (tabs, brace style) and tsconfig.json (array formatting for lib/exclude/include).\n\nFull regeneration of all Target/ compiled artifacts across bootstrap, effect, service, handler, gRPC, dual-track, type-converter, and webview layers. TypeScript build info updated accordingly.\n\nThis is a routine regeneration cycle with domain migration and new routing manifest infrastructure.",
